{
  "id": "eccSamGovBids01",
  "name": "ECC - Commercial cleaning bids (SAM.gov) -> HubSpot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "aeb99d8a-1f42-40f4-ba68-880bad98f8a3",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ECC - Commercial cleaning bids (SAM.gov)\nWeekdays 7am: pulls **new federal cleaning contract opportunities** from SAM.gov (free public API) for NAICS **561720 Janitorial** and **561790 Building/dwelling services**, posted in the last 2 days, nationwide.\nEach one becomes a **HubSpot deal** (description has the link + response deadline) and you get **one digest email** to your Gmail.\n\nNeeds: free SAM.gov API key (sam.gov -> Account details -> Public API key) saved as credential `SAM.gov API key` (Query Auth, name `api_key`), `HubSpot private app (ECC)`, `Resend SMTP (support@)`.\nOnly emails *you*.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b93997-f13e-4a77-8995-cb78632e161d",
      "name": "Weekdays 7am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8d17ee5a-87b1-44cd-a25f-5ac2e34b490e",
      "name": "Run now",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "a6220b06-07bc-4d2f-b5b3-15137550f229",
      "name": "NAICS codes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "54997fb7-0b16-4c53-8545-ea92f048b536",
              "name": "naics",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ [\"561720\", \"561790\"] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "15cc6072-c907-4cc1-8eba-a9b4a0a66bd4",
      "name": "Split NAICS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "naics",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2d2555d5-621e-405a-a629-a0472c6e66f1",
      "name": "SAM.gov search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.sam.gov/opportunities/v2/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpQueryAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "ncode",
              "value": "={{ $json.naics }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "postedFrom",
              "value": "={{ $now.minus({days: 2}).toFormat('MM/dd/yyyy') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "postedTo",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('MM/dd/yyyy') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "ptype",
              "value": "o,k,p"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpQueryAuth": {
          "name": "SAM.gov API key"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "3b3212e3-4260-411e-a2f8-b012107bf1e9",
      "name": "One per opportunity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "opportunitiesData",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e3f934cb-dc95-4970-ad8c-96292e78626b",
      "name": "Active only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1382773e-9015-4a48-be78-3f7fc9198bb7",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.active }}",
              "rightValue": "Yes",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c90279e6-da1e-4673-b059-900d5a68a5d5",
      "name": "HubSpot: bid deal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "deal",
        "operation": "create",
        "stage": "qualifiedtobuy",
        "additionalFields": {
          "dealName": "={{ 'BID: ' + $json.title.slice(0, 80) }}",
          "closeDate": "={{ $json.responseDeadLine ? DateTime.fromISO($json.responseDeadLine).toISO() : $now.plus({days: 14}).toISO() }}",
          "description": "={{ ($json.fullParentPathName || '') + '\\nPlace: ' + [$json.placeOfPerformance?.city?.name, $json.placeOfPerformance?.state?.code].filter(Boolean).join(', ') + '\\nSet-aside: ' + ($json.typeOfSetAsideDescription || 'none') + '\\nDeadline: ' + ($json.responseDeadLine || 'n/a') + '\\n' + $json.uiLink }}",
          "pipeline": "default"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "hubspotAppToken": {
          "name": "HubSpot private app (ECC)"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc14b3c-abaa-43f5-8d0e-4fde74f31909",
      "name": "Digest list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1540,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "bids",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e10e626c-27c2-48ce-8406-3a5948c4c93b",
      "name": "Email digest to owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "Express Cleaning Consult <support@expresscleaningconsult.com>",
        "toEmail": "expressconsulting92@gmail.com",
        "subject": "={{ $json.bids.length + ' new cleaning bids on SAM.gov (' + $now.toFormat('MMM d') + ')' }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "={{ $('Active only').all().map(b => '- ' + b.json.title + ' | ' + [b.json.placeOfPerformance?.city?.name, b.json.placeOfPerformance?.state?.code].filter(Boolean).join(', ') + ' | due ' + (b.json.responseDeadLine || 'n/a') + '\\n  ' + b.json.uiLink).join('\\n\\n') }}\n\nAll are also in HubSpot as deals starting with BID:.",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "name": "Resend SMTP (support@)"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
